ordering when an item is unknown or 429; can an item be shown twice, lost, or shown after confirmation (confirmed key 
never re-rendered - across tabs and after reload?); is anything dispatched before the IndexedDB commit is durable; can 
the composer clear when the write failed; D5 on every failure path (quota exceeded mid-transaction, versionchange 
