requests for the same key); replays that return an already-stored message do not consume it (D1). Independently, every 
create request (including replays, validation failures, and quota losers) consumes a per-user request budget, and 
fence/lookup calls consume their own per-user budget; exceeding any budget is a transient rate limit. | Must | AC-009 |
| FR-009 | An item not stored 24 h after the user pressed send is never sent automatically: once fenced as not stored, 
